"conf": -0.58,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 339.7,
"end": 345.5,
"text": "I never say a word.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 347.0,
"end": 349.3,
"text": "It's very important that you display it that way.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 349.8,
"end": 350.5,
"text": "Are you stopping?",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 351.0,
"end": 351.8,
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 352.0,
"end": 355.7,
"text": "That statement you've got now, I think, takes care of that.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 355.9,
"end": 356.8,
"text": "Just listen back.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 359.0,
"end": 360.5,
"text": "One other thing, Mr. President.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 360.6,
"end": 363.1,
"text": "Before I go away, I wanted to check with you.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 363.1,
"end": 368.1,
"text": "You're going to announce today the formation of an anti-terrorist cabinet-level committee.",
"conf": -0.43,
"no_speech": 0.11
},
{
"start": 368.1,
"end": 370.0,
"text": "if you are agreed with",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 370.0,
"end": 372.7,
"text": "he did when we said",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 372.7,
"end": 373.7,
"text": "you wanted it",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 373.7,
"end": 374.7,
"text": "he's chairman of it",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 374.7,
"end": 378.6,
"text": "the reason we do it",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 378.6,
"end": 380.4,
"text": "Mr. President, good for you meeting with the",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 380.4,
"end": 381.5,
"text": "Jewish leaders tomorrow",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 381.5,
"end": 383.5,
"text": "the Israelis want it",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 383.5,
"end": 385.8,
"text": "it doesn't cost us a god damn thing",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 385.8,
"end": 386.8,
"text": "it's like an economy",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 386.8,
"end": 390.1,
"text": "let's put",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 390.1,
"end": 391.9,
"text": "the head of the FBI on",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 391.9,
"end": 394.9,
"text": "I don't want",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 394.9,
"end": 396.2,
"text": "to be a part of a bunch of jerks",
"conf": -0.33,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 396.2,
"end": 398.3,
"text": "City? No, no, no. It's a cabinet",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 398.3,
"end": 400.4,
"text": "level committee. It gives Russia a lot of",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 400.4,
"end": 400.8,
"text": "prestige.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 403.7,
"end": 404.3,
"text": "That's what",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 404.3,
"end": 405.1,
"text": "both Helms and",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 405.1,
"end": 408.3,
"text": "both ex-officials, both Helms",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 408.3,
"end": 409.2,
"text": "and Pat Gray are",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 409.2,
"end": 411.4,
"text": "ex-officials.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 411.7,
"end": 414.2,
"text": "Easy to do. Secondly, I talked to",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 414.2,
"end": 416.4,
"text": "Dostoevsky about your meeting with the Jewish leaders.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 417.3,
"end": 418.3,
"text": "He thinks it",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 418.3,
"end": 420.3,
"text": "would be good if you made a brief opening",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 420.3,
"end": 420.8,
"text": "statement",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 420.8,
"end": 424.1,
"text": "and he said the way to handle it is",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.12
},
{
"start": 424.5,
"end": 426.4,
"text": "Don't let them ask you too many questions.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 426.9,
"end": 430.1,
"text": "You should say, I'm writing it up, and you'll get it.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 430.1,
"end": 433.5,
"text": "You should say, look, our policy has been consistent.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 433.7,
"end": 439.4,
"text": "Every bandit that goes to Israel, that Israel has, was put in by my administration.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 439.6,
"end": 441.0,
"text": "Two-thirds of them are skyhawks.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 442.1,
"end": 443.7,
"text": "We have supported Israel.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 444.2,
"end": 445.7,
"text": "We've done it for the election.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 446.6,
"end": 450.2,
"text": "We've done it for four years, and I would say we'll continue to do it,",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 450.3,
"end": 452.7,
"text": "because in that area we'll continue to support them.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.1
},
{
"start": 454.1,
"end": 472.1,
"text": "I mean, Hamid wanted to say, I made no big promises before the elections, and I'm going to be very cold-blooded with him, and I said, I'm quite aware of the fact that I had very little support from the Jewish community, and you're aware of that fact, but I did it because I believe that Israel's at risk there are, and that's why I'm supporting that.",
"conf": -0.31,
"no_speech": 0.33
},
{
"start": 472.1,
"end": 474.2,
"text": "I don't change my view",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 474.2,
"end": 477.1,
"text": "just four weeks before the election",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 477.1,
"end": 478.8,
"text": "or will I change it after the election",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 478.8,
"end": 481.2,
"text": "if you give them that feeling",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 481.2,
"end": 483.8,
"text": "and then you can say",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 483.8,
"end": 485.1,
"text": "now as for the immigration",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 485.1,
"end": 487.3,
"text": "I've also talked to Travis about it",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 487.3,
"end": 488.7,
"text": "without telling him",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 488.7,
"end": 491.1,
"text": "and he said that would be the life that would go well",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 491.1,
"end": 493.3,
"text": "he said as for the immigration",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 493.3,
"end": 494.7,
"text": "I would say we uphold it",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 494.7,
"end": 495.7,
"text": "this policy",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 495.7,
"end": 499.5,
"text": "but we have to act in our own way",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 499.5,
"end": 501.6,
"text": "in the context of this general commitment",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.09
},
{
"start": 501.6,
"end": 503.7,
"text": "one other thing",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 503.7,
"end": 511.5,
"text": "I would say now",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 511.5,
"end": 514.2,
"text": "a lot of people are not as aware",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 514.2,
"end": 516.0,
"text": "of the",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 516.0,
"end": 517.6,
"text": "conversations I've had",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 517.6,
"end": 519.9,
"text": "with the fire ministry",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 519.9,
"end": 521.9,
"text": "and I have a very close relationship",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 521.9,
"end": 524.3,
"text": "with her, she calls me on the phone",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 524.3,
"end": 526.1,
"text": "many times they don't read about it in the press",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 526.1,
"end": 528.0,
"text": "and I said she knows",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 528.0,
"end": 529.8,
"text": "she can come, she knows",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.4
},
{
"start": 529.8,
"end": 532.5,
"text": "when people talk loosely",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 532.5,
"end": 534.2,
"text": "about the fact",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 534.2,
"end": 535.9,
"text": "well we'll send American forces",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 535.9,
"end": 538.1,
"text": "Israel I said",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 538.1,
"end": 539.2,
"text": "probably going to go slim",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 539.2,
"end": 541.1,
"text": "I said the main thing",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 541.1,
"end": 542.7,
"text": "I talked to her about this",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 542.7,
"end": 545.2,
"text": "she said give us the arms",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 545.2,
"end": 547.1,
"text": "we can hold the region against the Russians",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 547.1,
"end": 548.2,
"text": "I said that's what we're doing",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 548.2,
"end": 550.5,
"text": "I'm going to stick a tooth on that",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 550.5,
"end": 552.9,
"text": "I think the other one that needs to be made",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 552.9,
"end": 555.1,
"text": "one thing is",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 555.1,
"end": 557.0,
"text": "over the past four years",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 557.0,
"end": 558.2,
"text": "whether it's from the Chinese",
"conf": -0.29,
"no_speech": 0.34
},
{
"start": 558.2,
"end": 563.2,
"text": "Russian and other areas, we've always done a lot more than you say.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 563.2,
"end": 565.2,
"text": "I'm not going to tell you what we've done.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 565.2,
"end": 569.2,
"text": "But I just want you to know this is what I believe for these people.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 569.2,
"end": 573.2,
"text": "But I know you've got to trust me as to the best way to do it.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 573.2,
"end": 575.2,
"text": "Extra. Something like that.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 575.2,
"end": 578.2,
"text": "And I wouldn't go into any further detail.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 578.2,
"end": 579.2,
"text": "I can't.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 579.2,
"end": 585.2,
"text": "Now, Rabin told me that McGovern, when he talked to this group,",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 585.2,
"end": 587.2,
"text": "talked a lot about the UN.",
"conf": -0.24,
"no_speech": 0.37
},
{
"start": 587.2,
"end": 591.0,
"text": "He said, let's turn them all off so you can get in a crack at the U.S.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 591.1,
"end": 592.7,
"text": "We're not counting at the U.S.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 592.7,
"end": 594.3,
"text": "We're doing it ourselves at some point.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 595.3,
"end": 597.9,
"text": "Secondly, Rafi told me, and I'm going to mention this to all of you,",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 598.7,
"end": 602.3,
"text": "that Gary Hart gave a speech at George Washington University last week",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 602.3,
"end": 605.2,
"text": "saying every time Israel makes a move against Lebanon or Syria,",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 605.3,
"end": 607.2,
"text": "the United States should publicly condemn it.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 608.9,
"end": 611.6,
"text": "And he said we ought to get that out.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 612.0,
"end": 614.0,
"text": "And he said we don't really.",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 614.8,
"end": 616.5,
"text": "And he'd get it out for us if we...",
"conf": -0.23,
"no_speech": 0.05
},
{
"start": 616.5,
"end": 618.5,
"text": "Why do we want to be allowed to sit in here?",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 619.2,
"end": 620.9,
"text": "We ought to probably condemn it.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 621.6,
"end": 623.6,
"text": "Gary Hart said we ought to condemn it",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 623.6,
"end": 625.1,
"text": "every time it moves again.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 626.0,
"end": 626.5,
"text": "Good.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 626.7,
"end": 626.8,
"text": "Yeah.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 629.3,
"end": 630.6,
"text": "I'll tell him right now.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 631.2,
"end": 634.1,
"text": "He says if anybody here takes Gary Hart on,",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 634.2,
"end": 637.0,
"text": "he will see to it that it will go all over the Jewish community.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 637.7,
"end": 639.7,
"text": "He just has to have a text to hang it on.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 640.4,
"end": 642.2,
"text": "I mean, Rabin is all out on our side.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 642.4,
"end": 643.1,
"text": "He said that?",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 643.2,
"end": 644.0,
"text": "The son of a bitch?",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 644.1,
"end": 644.3,
"text": "Yeah.",
"conf": -0.36,
"no_speech": 0.15
},
{
"start": 644.3,
"end": 649.3,
"text": "But we've been very careful about that. We think we should have done that privately, you know.",
"conf": -0.39,
"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 649.3,
"end": 650.3,
"text": "That's right.",
"conf": -0.39,
"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 650.3,
"end": 651.3,
"text": "Never publicly.",
"conf": -0.39,
"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 651.3,
"end": 653.3,
"text": "That's right. That's why you mentioned it.",
"conf": -0.39,
"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 658.3,
"end": 660.3,
"text": "I think Gary Hart's not a Semitic.",
"conf": -0.39,
"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 660.3,
"end": 665.3,
"text": "Oh, Rick Stearns is the one that's not a Semitic.",
"conf": -0.39,
"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 666.3,
"end": 670.3,
"text": "Why is it that in that crowd they would have men so they had a Semitism when you tell me?",
"conf": -0.39,
"no_speech": 0.31
},
{
"start": 670.3,
"end": 674.3,
"text": "Why in the name of God? Because he's got to have the Jewish soldiers.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
"start": 674.3,
"end": 678.3,
"text": "Why aren't they? And afterwards it is. No, he's a Jewish. He's a Lebanese.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
"start": 678.3,
"end": 680.3,
"text": "He's probably Jewish.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
"start": 680.3,
"end": 683.3,
"text": "But this makes a difference. The point is, why are they taking off?",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
"start": 683.3,
"end": 685.3,
"text": "Because they're radicals.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
"start": 685.3,
"end": 688.3,
"text": "Well, they ought to, but they're indoctrinated. They're radicals now.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
"start": 688.3,
"end": 692.3,
"text": "They're forming an international radical movement.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
"start": 692.3,
"end": 696.3,
"text": "And so therefore they're on the side of the guerrillas.",
"conf": -0.32,
"no_speech": 0.26
},
{
